    "text": "1 hours ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-03-04 22:02:00 CST Expires: 2026-03-04 22:30:00 CST Urgency: Expected Severity: Moderate Certainty: Observed Instruction: If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building. Target Area: Atoka At 1002 PM CST, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 5 miles west of Caney, moving northeast at 40 mph.\nHAZARD...Half inch hail.\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\nIMPACT...Minor damage to outdoor objects is possible.\nLocations impacted include... Atoka, Stringtown, Tushka, Caney, Lane, and southwestern Atoka Reservoir.",
